 ) located in buildings, where the highest occupied floor is 75 feet (22 860) or less above the lowest level of Fire Department vehicle access, shall be provided with automatic smoke detection connected to an automatic fire alarm system in accordance with Section 907.2.13.1 and an emergency voice/alarm communication system in accordance with Section 907.5.2.2 that initiates a total evacuation signal.
